      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create embed_for_search.py in the current working directory.\nTask: embeds a query and documents for semantic search.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc328ea6001Iqg5mh7VHLVUwW",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc328ea40018rQkcs1JAIJ18G",
